@title LabNFT
@dev Full ERC-721 implementation for the Tokenization Lab.
Students learn: balanceOf, ownerOf, approve, transferFrom, tokenURI, mint.
Uses ERC721URIStorage for per-token metadata (data URIs or URLs).

@title LabNFTSale
@dev Simple single-listing NFT-for-ETH sale. Seller lists, buyer pays, atomic swap.
For Tokenization Lab: teaches escrow, approve, and payable patterns.

@title PoSSimulator - Enhanced Educational Proof-of-Stake Simulator
